# Three CI slots. Do not add a fourth Julia version job.
# Slide the pin; keep job names min / max / tip (branch protection stays put).
#
# min  Project.toml julia floor. Required. E2E, docs, bake, GHCR worker.
# max  Newest tagged or prerelease in versions.json. Required for Pkg.test, Aqua, JETLS.
# tip  Next-minor nightly. continue-on-error. No JETLS, E2E, or docs.
JULIA_SLOT_MIN=1.12
JULIA_SLOT_MAX=~1.13.0-0
JULIA_SLOT_TIP=1.14-nightly
